```
card.onLogo("touch", () => { screen.showIcon("heart"); });
card.onLogo("release", () => { screen.clear(); });
```

You touch the logo at t = 0 s and lift your finger at t = 2 s. What does the screen look like at t = 1 s and t = 3 s?

